                    "name": "Andrew V. Teylu"
                },
                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2026-08-23T16:21:54Z",
                    "email": "andrew.teylu@vector.com",
                    "name": "Andrew V. Teylu"
                },
                "message": "Remove inconsistent C4551 explanatory comments\n\nFollow-up to #7911. The comments explaining why the unused-helper\n\"touch\" statements take the function's address (to avoid MSVC C4551)\nwere only added at a few of the many touch sites, so they made those\nparticular (void)&func; lines look more significant than the rest\nwithout actually helping a reader who hits one of the uncommented sites.\nDrop them; the (void)&func; fix itself is unchanged.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code (Opus 4.8), pair-programming with the author\nSigned-off-by: Andrew V. Teylu <andrew.teylu@vector.com>",
